1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,710
OpenAI has countersued Apple over alleged trade secret theft

2
00:00:03,760 --> 00:00:07,090
It filed on 27 November in a California federal court

3
00:00:07,140 --> 00:00:09,190
OpenAI claims Apple obtained its device roadmap

4
00:00:09,240 --> 00:00:10,990
through a re-hired engineer

5
00:00:11,040 --> 00:00:12,790
It alleges Apple threatened shared suppliers

6
00:00:12,840 --> 00:00:14,210
with lost contracts

7
00:00:14,260 --> 00:00:17,490
OpenAI says around 400 specialists have moved from Apple

8
00:00:17,540 --> 00:00:20,470
Apple sued first in July and rejects the allegations

9
00:00:20,520 --> 00:00:22,650
Analysts say OpenAI is building AI devices

10
00:00:22,700 --> 00:00:24,350
with Jony Ive's team

11
00:00:24,400 --> 00:00:27,150
Would Gulf companies choose OpenAI devices over iPhones?
